+#: ../../source/developer_guide/contribution/doc_writing.md:348
+msgid "What to change"
+msgstr "需要修改的内容"
+
+#: ../../source/developer_guide/contribution/doc_writing.md:350
+msgid "In `tools/docs_codegen/converters.py`:"
