+msgid ""
+"Add a `BaseConverter` subclass that implements `convert(loaded_yaml, *, "
+"block) -> GeneratedScript`"
+msgstr ""
+"添加一个`BaseConverter`子类，实现`convert(loaded_yaml, *, block) -> GeneratedScript`"
