+msgstr "在`build_default_converters()`中注册"
+
+#: ../../source/developer_guide/contribution/doc_writing.md:355
+msgid ""
+"Reuse the shared validation/rendering helpers in "
+"`tools/docs_codegen/utils.py` (`require_yaml_mapping`, `require_mapping`,"
