+
+#: ../../source/developer_guide/contribution/doc_writing.md:363
+msgid ""
+"Add the option name to `ModelCodeDirective.option_spec` in "
+"`tools/docs_codegen/sphinx_extension.py`"
+msgstr ""
+"将选项名称添加到`tools/docs_codegen/sphinx_extension.py`的`ModelCodeDirective.option_spec`中"
+
+#: ../../source/developer_guide/contribution/doc_writing.md:365
+msgid ""
+"Add a real example snippet in any model doc (recommended under "
+"`docs/source/tutorials/models/`) and point it to a YAML file that exists "
+"(recommended under `tests/`)."
+msgstr ""
+"在任何模型文档中添加真实示例片段（建议放在`docs/source/tutorials/models/`下），并指向一个存在的YAML文件（建议放在`tests/`下）。"
+
+#: ../../source/developer_guide/contribution/doc_writing.md:367
+msgid "Minimal validation via CLI:"
+msgstr "通过CLI进行最小验证："
+
+#: ../../source/developer_guide/contribution/doc_writing.md:369
+msgid ""
+"`python3 tools/docs_codegen/cli.py --doc <your_doc>` or `--block "
+"<doc>::<block_name>`"
+msgstr ""
+"`python3 tools/docs_codegen/cli.py --doc <your_doc>` 或 `--block <doc>::<block_name>`"
