+#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Hy3-preview.md:1
+msgid "Hy3-preview"
+msgstr "Hy3-preview"
+
+#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Hy3-preview.md:3
+msgid "Introduction"
+msgstr "简介"
+
+#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Hy3-preview.md:5
+msgid ""
+"Hy3-preview is a Mixture-of-Experts model, with 295B total parameters, "
+"21B active parameters and 3.8B MTP layer parameters, developed by the "
+"Tencent Hy Team. It is the first model trained on Tencent rebuilt "
+"infrastructure. It improves significantly on complex reasoning, "
+"instruction following, context learning, coding, and agent tasks."
+msgstr ""
+"Hy3-preview 是一个混合专家模型，总参数量295B，激活参数量21B，MTP层参数量3.8B，由腾讯混元团队开发。它是首个在腾讯重建基础设施上训练的模型，在复杂推理、指令遵循、上下文学习、编码和智能体任务上均有显著提升。"
+
+#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Hy3-preview.md:7
+msgid ""
+"This guide records the verified vLLM Ascend serving path for Hy3-preview "
+"on one Atlas A3 16-NPU node. The verified default path is TP16 + EP + MTP"
+" + ACLGraph."
+msgstr ""
+"本指南记录了在单个 Atlas A3 16-NPU 节点上，经过验证的 Hy3-preview vLLM Ascend 服务路径。已验证的默认路径为 TP16 + EP + MTP + ACLGraph。"
+
+#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Hy3-preview.md:9
+msgid "Supported Features"
+msgstr "支持的特性"
+
+#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Hy3-preview.md:11
+msgid ""
+"Refer to [supported "
+"features](../../user_guide/support_matrix/supported_models.md) to get the"
+" model's supported feature matrix."
+msgstr ""
+"请参考[支持的特性](../../user_guide/support_matrix/supported_models.md)获取模型支持的特性矩阵。"
+
+#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Hy3-preview.md:13
+msgid ""
+"Refer to [feature guide](../../user_guide/feature_guide/index.md) to get "
+"the feature's configuration."
+msgstr ""
+"请参考[特性指南](../../user_guide/feature_guide/index.md)获取特性的配置方法。"
+
+#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Hy3-preview.md:15
+msgid "Environment Preparation"
+msgstr "环境准备"
+
+#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Hy3-preview.md:17
+msgid "Model Weight"
+msgstr "模型权重"
+
+#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Hy3-preview.md:19
+msgid ""
+"Hugging Face: "
+"[tencent/Hy3-preview](https://huggingface.co/tencent/Hy3-preview)"
+msgstr ""
+"Hugging Face：[tencent/Hy3-preview](https://huggingface.co/tencent/Hy3-preview)"
+
+#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Hy3-preview.md:20
+msgid ""
+"ModelScope: [Tencent-Hunyuan/Hy3-preview](https://modelscope.cn/models"
+"/Tencent-Hunyuan/Hy3-preview)"
+msgstr ""
+"ModelScope：[Tencent-Hunyuan/Hy3-preview](https://modelscope.cn/models/Tencent-Hunyuan/Hy3-preview)"
+
+#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Hy3-preview.md:21
+msgid ""
+"GitCode: "
+"[tencent_hunyuan/Hy3-preview](https://ai.gitcode.com/tencent_hunyuan/Hy3-preview)"
+msgstr ""
+"GitCode：[tencent_hunyuan/Hy3-preview](https://ai.gitcode.com/tencent_hunyuan/Hy3-preview)"
+
+#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Hy3-preview.md:23
+msgid ""
+"Download or mount the checkpoint to a path shared by the runtime "
+"container, for example `/models/Hy3-preview`."
+msgstr ""
+"将检查点下载或挂载到运行时容器共享的路径，例如 `/models/Hy3-preview`。"
+
+#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Hy3-preview.md:25
+msgid "Hardware"
+msgstr "硬件"
+
+#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Hy3-preview.md:27
+msgid ""
+"The verified configuration uses one Atlas A3 node with 16 NPUs and 64 GB "
+"HBM per NPU. The real-weight run used about 58 GB process memory per NPU "
+"after startup."
+msgstr ""
+"已验证的配置使用一个 Atlas A3 节点，包含16个NPU，每个NPU配备64 GB HBM。实际权重运行启动后，每个NPU约使用58 GB进程内存。"
+
+#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Hy3-preview.md:29
+msgid "Installation"
+msgstr "安装"
+
+#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Hy3-preview.md:31
+msgid ""
+"You can use our official docker image to run Hy3-preview directly. For "
+"Atlas A3 machines, select the image variant with the `-a3` suffix. The "
+"official image already includes the vLLM and vLLM Ascend runtime needed "
+"for the verified serving path."
+msgstr ""
+"您可以直接使用官方 Docker 镜像运行 Hy3-preview。对于 Atlas A3 机器，请选择带有 `-a3` 后缀的镜像变体。官方镜像已包含验证服务路径所需的 vLLM 和 vLLM Ascend 运行时。"
+
+#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Hy3-preview.md:70
+msgid ""
+"In addition, if you don't want to use the docker image as above, you can "
+"also build all from source:"
+msgstr ""
+"此外，如果您不想使用上述 Docker 镜像，也可以从源码构建所有组件："
+
+#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Hy3-preview.md:72
+msgid ""
+"Install `vllm-ascend` from source, refer to "
+"[installation](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
+"ascend/blob/main/docs/source/installation.md)."
+msgstr ""
+"从源码安装 `vllm-ascend`，请参考[安装指南](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/docs/source/installation.md)。"
+
+#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Hy3-preview.md:74
+msgid "Deployment"
+msgstr "部署"
+
+#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Hy3-preview.md:76
+msgid "Single-node Deployment"
+msgstr "单节点部署"
+
+#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Hy3-preview.md:78
+msgid "Run `vllm serve` from `/workspace`."
+msgstr "在 `/workspace` 目录下运行 `vllm serve`。"
+
+#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Hy3-preview.md:101
+msgid ""
+"`--enable-ep-weight-filter` is optional. It skips expert weights that do "
+"not belong to the local EP rank during loading, reducing disk and host-"
+"memory pressure for very large MoE checkpoints. We recommend keeping it "
+"enabled."
+msgstr ""
+"`--enable-ep-weight-filter` 是可选的。它在加载时跳过不属于本地 EP rank 的专家权重，从而减少超大 MoE 检查点的磁盘和主机内存压力。建议保持启用。"
+
+#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Hy3-preview.md:102
+msgid ""
+"Tool calling and reasoning are service interfaces declared in the Hy3 "
+"README, so it is recommended to pass the corresponding `hy_v3` parsers by"
+" default."
+msgstr ""
+"工具调用和推理是 Hy3 README 中声明的服务接口，因此建议默认传递相应的 `hy_v3` 解析器。"
+
