 "Previously, the environment variables VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_PREFETCH_MLP "
@@ -698,28 +702,29 @@ msgid ""
 "\"down\": 1.0}}}. See User Guide->Feature Guide->Weight Prefetch Guide "
 "for details."
 msgstr ""
-"以前，用于启用 MLP 权重预取的环境变量 VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_PREFETCH_MLP，"
-"以及用于设置 MLP gate_up_proj 和 down_proj 权重预取大小的 VLLM_ASCEND_MLP_GATE_UP_PREFETCH_SIZE 和 VLLM_ASCEND_MLP_DOWN_PREFETCH_SIZE 已被弃用。"
