+msgid ""
+"Added Flash Attention 3 support for training-inference consistency. The "
+"backend is ready in vLLM Ascend and will become directly usable once the "
+"FA3 package is publicly available. [#9060](https://github.com/vllm-"
+"project/vllm-ascend/pull/9060)"
+msgstr ""
+"添加了 Flash Attention 3 支持以实现训练推理一致性。后端已在 vLLM Ascend 中就绪，待 FA3 包公开发布后即可直接使用。[#9060](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/9060)"
+
+#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:15
+msgid ""
+"Added DeepSeek PCP/DCP adaptation to improve support for disaggregated "
+"deployments. [#9058](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
+"ascend/pull/9058)"
+msgstr ""
+"添加了 DeepSeek PCP/DCP 适配以改进对分离式部署的支持。[#9058](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/9058)"
+
+#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:16
+msgid ""
+"Added a dedicated `additional_config.enable_dsa_cp` switch to decouple "
+"DSA-CP from FC1. DSA-CP now requires both FC1 and DSA-CP to be explicitly"
+" enabled, allowing FC1 to stay enabled while DSA-CP is disabled when "
+"needed. [#9878](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/9878)"
+msgstr ""
+"添加了专用的 `additional_config.enable_dsa_cp` 开关以将 DSA-CP 与 FC1 解耦。DSA-CP 现在需要同时显式启用 FC1 和 DSA-CP，允许在需要时保持 FC1 启用而禁用 DSA-CP。[#9878](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/9878)"
+
+#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:17
+msgid ""
+"Added merged graph support for DFlash workloads. "
+"[#9074](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/9074)"
+msgstr ""
+"为 DFlash 工作负载添加了合并图支持。[#9074](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/9074)"
