+"ascend/issues/9958)"
+
+#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:63
+msgid ""
+"GLM5 W4A8 deployments can see a significantly lower speculative decoding "
+"acceptance rate when MTP3 is used together with FlashComm. "
+"[#9803](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/issues/9803)"
+msgstr ""
+"GLM5 W4A8 部署在 MTP3 与 FlashComm 一起使用时，推测解码接受率可能显著降低。[#9803](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/issues/9803)"
+
+#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:64
+msgid ""
+"MiniMax-M2.7 W8A8/QuaRot can show lower-than-expected GPQA accuracy in "
+"long-sequence deployments when PCP/DCP is combined with Eagle3 "
+"speculative decoding. [#9959](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
+"ascend/issues/9959)"
+msgstr ""
+"MiniMax-M2.7 W8A8/QuaRot 在长序列部署中，当 PCP/DCP 与 Eagle3 推测解码结合使用时，"
+"GPQA 准确率可能低于预期。[#9959](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
+"ascend/issues/9959)"
+
+#: ../../source/user_guide/release_notes.md:65
+msgid ""
+"KV Pool feature for DeepSeek V4 now faces several known issues affecting "
+"user-friendliness and performance, including special startup parameter "
+"requirements, special key storing behaviors, etc. For details, please "
+"refer to issue [#9975](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
+"ascend/issues/9975)."
+msgstr ""
+"DeepSeek V4 的 KV Pool 功能目前存在多个已知问题，影响用户友好性和性能，包括特殊的启动参数要求、"
+"特殊的键存储行为等。详情请参考 issue [#9975](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
+"ascend/issues/9975)。"
+
